    <!-- Dialog Credits -->
    <string name="appDescription">
<![CDATA[
<h2><center>About Questwave</center></h2>
<h4 style="margin-left:5px;">Questwave is an Android client for interactive text games in the <b>QSP</b> format. It is built on the open-source <b>Questopia</b> project, which continues the <b>QuestPlayer Android</b> port by seedhartha. The QSP engine is <b>QSP 5.9.5</b> from the QSP Foundation.</h4>
<h4 style="margin-left:5px;">This is a private, locally built application. It is not affiliated with, sponsored by or endorsed by Questopia, QuestPlayer, the QSP Foundation or Quest Soft Player. Game files and their content belong to their authors.</h4>
]]>
    </string>
